{
 "about": "knot_untying redesign: the robot-level routes per instance on the current head (10-13). Routes, not frozen references: every reference is recorded once after the physics freeze (oracle on the frozen head, fresh replays on two hosts, acceptance, videos). Rows are 40 per simulated second. 'chain': stage 1 ends with --stop-after-decisions N (its rows are saved), stage 2 resumes them (--resume <stage 1>/privileged.npz); every chain below was re-made from its flags on this code with rows and tick ledger byte-equal to the original. Hashes: 'actions' = sha256[:16] of the action rows, 'state' = the Session's state hash at the end.",
